    "detailed_description": "<strong>\u25c6 Caution</strong><br>All characters in this work are over 18 years old.<br><br><br><strong>\u25c6 This is a traditional Japanese hentai game called &quot;DATSUI BLOCK-KUZUSHI&quot;.</strong><br>It is a genre of hentai games with deep memories for Japanese people who have spent the 2000s with the Internet.<br>Play with anime beauties drawn with nostalgic pixel art!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860760/extras/11b564f3ba4605d675df77bff3f0c0f4.avif?t=1646270781\" /></div><br><br><br><strong>\u25c6 A fast-paced, casual BREAKOUT game.</strong><br>In this game, you will be able to break down the clothes of a beautiful anime girl instead of blocks.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860760/extras/d2a3f1efd1e2d8cb4e0104ccd5856e4b.poster.avif?t=1646270781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860760/extras/d2a3f1efd1e2d8cb4e0104ccd5856e4b.webm?t=1646270781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860760/extras/d2a3f1efd1e2d8cb4e0104ccd5856e4b.mp4?t=1646270781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Once all the blocks are broken, a differential hentai image will be added from the select menu!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860760/extras/681b39f1509fb1314e7208198978fce0.poster.avif?t=1646270781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860760/extras/681b39f1509fb1314e7208198978fce0.webm?t=1646270781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860760/extras/681b39f1509fb1314e7208198978fce0.mp4?t=1646270781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>\u25c6 How to Play</strong><br>You can play with mouse only.<br>Left click: Confirm, Shoot (in game, at start of round), Bomb (in game, after shooting)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860760/extras/8f61ec1d49cf47c84936b5d9b87e5896.poster.avif?t=1646270781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860760/extras/8f61ec1d49cf47c84936b5d9b87e5896.webm?t=1646270781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860760/extras/8f61ec1d49cf47c84936b5d9b87e5896.mp4?t=1646270781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Right-click: Back, Pause, Menu (in game)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860760/extras/c256c96409cb0d87a775add7db31dfe8.poster.avif?t=1646270781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860760/extras/c256c96409cb0d87a775add7db31dfe8.webm?t=1646270781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860760/extras/c256c96409cb0d87a775add7db31dfe8.mp4?t=1646270781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>\u25c6 High Score Tips</strong><br>The most important point is not to make mistakes.<br>Use the left-click bomb to break the blocks at once and clear them quickly!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860760/extras/5a1c78ac1082392e86bbf4b7ec90e27b.poster.avif?t=1646270781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860760/extras/5a1c78ac1082392e86bbf4b7ec90e27b.webm?t=1646270781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860760/extras/5a1c78ac1082392e86bbf4b7ec90e27b.mp4?t=1646270781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>\u25c6 Play time</strong><br>It takes about 20-30 minutes to complete all the levels.",
